  <name>Threshold</name>
  <summary>Battery charge threshold controller</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Threshold provides a graphical interface for setting the
      battery charge threshold on laptops with EC charge-threshold
      support. The charge limit is written directly to the EC via the
      kernel's charge-threshold sysfs interface and persists across
      reboots.
    </p>
  </description>
