  <releases>
    <release version="1.4.0" date="2026-08-23">
      <description>
        <p>
          Critical fixes for hardware synchronization and module loading.
          Add continuous polling to detect EC threshold changes after startup.
          Fix msi-ec packaging to ensure module loads correctly (no --no-depmod,
          modules-load.d entry, udev triggers). Reduce top card spacing for better
          proportionality with text.
        </p>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="1.3.0" date="2026-08-23">
      <description>
        <p>
          Merge msi-ec-dkms into the threshold package as a single
          amd64 .deb.  Add automatic control-mode detection (msi-ec,
          vendor/sysfs, notification-only) and a charge-threshold
          reached alarm for devices without EC/sysfs charge control.
        </p>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="1.2.0" date="2026-08-15">
      <description>
        <p>
          Rename project to Threshold and generalise from MSI-only
          branding to any laptop with EC charge-threshold support;
          add multi-device battery discovery and a scroll-free window
          layout.
        </p>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="1.1.0" date="2026-08-01">
